for-India-Driving-Dataset","owner":"lordlosslyy","html_url":"https://github.com/lordlosslyy/Semantic-Segmentation-CNN-for-India-Driving-Dataset","stars":5,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"We use deep convolutional neural networks to experiment semantic segmentation task on India Driving Dataset. We use pixel accuracy and Intersection-Over-Union as the evaluation metrics and experiment different kinds of methods, including weighted loss, data augmentation, transfer learning, and U-Net architecture. Weighted loss method achieved 61.07% average IoU and data augmentation method with rotated and cropped images achieved 63.73% IoU. However, it largely increases the training time. Using the transfer learning VGG, we achieve 73.74% average pixel accuracy and 58.45% average IoU on the test set. In addition, we achieve 78.03% average test pixel accuracy and 64.04% average test IoU by the method of U-Net. Finally, we build a new model named Mobile-Deeplabv3+, and we achieved 83.56% average pixel accuracy and 71.35% average IoU on the test set.","topics":[],"score":289083,"global_rank":27913,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5817},{"name":"ihmeuw-msca/pplkit","owner":"ihmeuw-msca","html_url":"https://github.com/ihmeuw-msca/pplkit","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Pipeline building toolkit","topics":[],"score":289079,"global_rank":27919,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5818},{"name":"Dillonb/binaryninja-n64-loader","owner":"Dillonb","html_url":"https://github.com/Dillonb/binaryninja-n64-loader","stars":2,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":289077,"global_rank":27920,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5819},{"name":"FredHutch/nextflow-aws-batch-squared","owner":"FredHutch","html_url":"https://github.com/FredHutch/nextflow-aws-batch-squared","stars":10,"forks":3,"watchers":8,"issues":4,"language":"Python",